# Build context for ops/video/Dockerfile (context = repository root). BuildKit reads this file
# instead of the root .dockerignore for this Dockerfile. Only what the worker runs goes in: never
# .env files, credentials, or anything else in the repository.
**
!ops/video/package.json
!ops/video/worker.sh
!tools/video/**
!.agents/skills/youtube-video/**
!docs/videos/**
!apps/api/app/guides/content/**
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
